column147:
09/Oct/26 1:10 PM;557058:0867a421-a9ee-4659-801a-bc0ee4a4487e;either use .aab:

{noformat}gradle(task: "bundleProduction")   # or bundleRelease, whichever build type you ship
upload_to_play_store(
  track: 'internal',
  aab: 'app/build/outputs/bundle/production/app-production.aab'
){noformat}

or the apk with the mapping file:

{noformat}upload_to_play_store(
  track: 'internal',
  apk: 'app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk',
  mapping: 'app/build/outputs/mapping/release/mapping.txt'
){noformat}
